// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1189325508" "<t=3><t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkblue>ATTENTION: Multiple energy anomalies detected. Threat code increased to Crimson. All units, prepare for hostile incursion. Primary targets appear to be Shivan in nature. Engage at will."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
