// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2044676794" "Goodbye, {HeroName}! Another time, perhaps!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3974103131" "Your combat abilities are... more potent than my data implied. I suppose that's what I get for trusting the historians."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2300234608" "I may have misjudged you, {HeroName}. You have my attention. What do you wish to know?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1267292405" "I'm here for the same thing you are. I'm looking for clues on Pandora's Box. I have records of your last known location before you time-jumped to Achaea, so I figured I would drop in on your operation and learn how you did it."
// Script Variable SaysList :
