// Dialog :
"P725889429" "You spoke with Romulus Augustus, but appear to be no closer to finding Pandora's Box."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4247838725" "<color orange>Antonio grins at you.</color><br><br>Welcome back, chrononaut. I trust your sojourn into history was fruitful?<br><br><color orange>Antonio's grin fades as you relate your recent journey to Achaea.</color><br><br>Well, it's not as much info as we'd like, but it's something. We know that Pandora's Box was in Ancient Greece at one point, and someone elected to move it... still, it doesn't really help us pinpoint its location. I think we're going to need to call in a specialist for this job."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - AzuriaTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IsOwner Text :
"P2036944367" "<color orange>Azuria looks more tired than you've ever seen her before. She pushes her hair out of her face in a distracted manner before speaking with you.</color><br><br>Hello, {HeroName}. I'm sorry, but I don't have the information that you're looking for."
// Answer Text :
"P2445127294" "So you don't know where-"
// Answer Text :
"P1212355748" "Why was Odysseus-"
// Page Where Text :
"P1515228023" "No, I'm afraid not, {HeroName}. So far, Pandora's Box has managed to elude my numerous attempts at scrying, and I...<br><br><color orange>Azuria stops for a moment, blinking dazedly.</color><br><br>I'm sorry... you didn't even finish your question. I try not to do that, normally... I've just been stretched thin lately. Galaxy City was a disaster for M.A.G.I., and now I'm also fielding calls about Pandora's Box at least twice a day...<br><br>Sorry. I don't mean to complain. I'm just tired, that's all."
// Answer Text :
"P1819883988" "It's fine. Is there anything you can tell me about the Box?"
// Page Odysseus Text :
"P2424190106" "The same reason you're here, {HeroName}. He's trying to track down Pandora's Box. Unfortunately for the both of you, I haven't been able to...<br><br><color orange>Azuria stops for a moment, blinking dazedly.</color><br><br>I'm sorry... you didn't even finish your question. I try not to do that, normally... I've just been stretched thin lately. Galaxy City was a disaster for M.A.G.I., and now I'm also fielding calls about Pandora's Box at least twice a day...<br><br>Sorry. I don't mean to complain. I'm just tired, that's all."
// Page Info Text :
"P2925708661" "The Box itself seems to block any attempt I make at scrying its location. I'm sure it has some level of arcane protection built in. I've tried more roundabout methods - searching for the word 'Pandora', or anyone who might have information on the Box - but I haven't turned up much.<br><br>The best I've got is an archaeology professor from Oxford named James Harvan. He seems to have a lot of tangential knowledge about the mythos surrounding Pandora's Box, but that's all the info I can manage. I'm a seer, not a psychic.<br><br>Anyway, he's on some expedition right now, and I can't really leave M.A.G.I.'s operations in Paragon behind. If you want to look Harvan up, be my guest."
// Answer Text :
"P175523874" "Thanks, Azuria."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1768205724" "So, we know that Pandora's Box is pretty old - it has a few thousand years to its name, at the least. In Achaea, people believed it was a tool of the gods. Now, I have no idea if this thing is magic in nature, but I do know that for all historical intents and purposes, it may as well have been.<br><br>So, if we're looking for an ancient and powerful magical artifact, I can only think of one person I'd want to ask about it."
// AcceptString :
"P2052070648" "And who would that be?"
// SendOffString :
"P520125735" "M.A.G.I.'s top arcane quarantine expert: Azuria. She's been a bit busy ever since the attack on Galaxy City; the M.A.G.I. vault there was destroyed, and Azuria's in charge of the team responsible for rounding up all of the artifacts that were lost in the attack.<br><br>You should rendezvous with her, see if she might be able to point us in the right direction. You'll probably catch her working one of M.A.G.I.'s storehouses... with all of the minor relics that the Hellions have been caught with, they've been struggling to find safe places for all of them."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1580884444" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Professional Advice</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2962857005" "Ask Azuria for Advice"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3412292344" "If anyone can clue us in on where to look for Pandora's Box, it's got to be Azuria."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3382802999" "This is the place that Antonio directed you to... but something's not right here. The door's been kicked in, and you can hear shouts and clanging steel in the distance."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - OnEnterObjectiveComplete 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - SetObjectiveText 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1225210051" "Find Azuria"
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - SetObjectiveText 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2517086185" "Speak with Azuria"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P2284848685" "Azuria"
// Script Variable PET_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2050336522" "<t 4>David... before we continue, I do have one question for you.<t 0>Did you really think you could get the drop... on a seer?"
// Script Variable PET_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3791873805" "<t 2><t 0><em laugh2>Why, hello {HeroName}. Your timing is impeccable."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3179633309" "You're not my target today, {HeroName}. You can walk away from this."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4264843526" "I'm just here... to get some answers! I swear!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2234662766" "I thought Heroes... were supposed to be reasonable..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P505531686" "Now, my dear. Where were we?"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P501843626" "You are your own worst enemy, David. I hope you realize that."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P942436319" "Odysseus"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1109363712" "<t 2><t 0>By all means, my dear. Ask away."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2218968429" "{HeroName}! Of all the rotten luck..."
// Script Variable WaveShout :
"P1936714319" "<shout>Stop {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3609192693" "{HeroName}, it's you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2414529783" "Hello, {HeroName}. I'm sorry, but I don't have the information that you're looking for."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P898286231" "No, I'm afraid not, {HeroName}. So far, Pandora's Box has managed to elude my numerous attempts at scrying..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3347476300" "The same reason you're here, {HeroName}. He's trying to track down Pandora's Box. Unfortunately for the both of you, I haven't been able to..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2501970494" "The best I've got is an archaeology professor from Oxford named James Harvan. He seems to have a lot of tangential knowledge about the mythos surrounding Pandora's Box. If you want to look Harvan up, be my guest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P938995561" "Azuria gave you info that might prove useful in the search for Pandora's Box."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3840476884" "An expert on Pandora's Box, huh? Well, it's a whole lot better than nothing. I'll see if I can track this guy, maybe set up a meeting between the two of you. If this Harvan fellow can assist in the search, then we need to speak with him as soon as possible."
// RandomFameString :
"P1891301743" "The PPD were trying to take Odysseus away, but every time they tried to cuff him, the cuffs melted. Wonder who took that guy down."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - StudentTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IsOwner Text :
"P2419672444" "<color orange>Fear and hope flash across the student's face as he tries to gauge whether or not you are a threat. He's clearly not in a stable state of mind.</color><br><br>W-what's going on here? What did that woman want with Professor Harvan?<br><br>This is too freaky. Did you <i>see</i> those guys? Who <i>dresses</i> like that?"
// Answer Text :
"P1540573212" "Get out more, kid. You've never heard of Arachnos?"
// Answer Text :
"P2457160439" "Calm down. I need you to tell me where Dr. Harvan is."
// Page Arachnos Text :
"P2665640186" "<color orange>The student's eyes widen in fear and recognition.</color><br><br>Wait... that wasn't...<br><br>You mean those guys were <b><i>Arachnos</b></i>? Oh, man... oh man! I need to get out of here! This is not good!<br><br>Arachnos is, like, seriously dangerous! We can't be here! We'll <b><i>die</b></i>!"
// Answer Text :
"P2115950160" "I can handle them, kid. Just tell me where Harvan is."
// Page Arachnos2 Text :
"P1002625593" "<color orange>The student seems to calm down a bit, reacting instinctively to your confidence.</color><br><br>Yeah... uh, yeah, Professor Harvan. He's in the deepest section of the cave, he was... he was trying to map out the cavern structure so we could start excavating soon...<br><br><color orange>The student fidgets nervously in front of you.</color><br><br>Can... can I go now? I'd like to, um, leave."
// Answer Text :
"P2551626067" "Yeah, go on. Thanks for your help."
// Page Heroic Text :
"P3777855179" "<color orange>The student recognizes you as a Hero, and appears visibly relieved.</color><br><br>I... I think I've seen you on TV before. {HeroName}, right?<br><br>Professor Harvan's deeper in the cavern. He wanted to map out the cavern so that we could start excavating...<br><br>That woman wasn't the only one after him. She had more people with her. Please, you have to help the Professor!"
// Answer Text :
"P3679070038" "I'm on it. Get to a safe place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HarvanTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IsOwner Text :
"P165890982" "<color orange>Doctor Harvan appears to be somewhat flustered, but otherwise unharmed. Arachnos probably wanted him for the same reason you do.</color><br><br>Now see here, young {Hero.gender=male man|lady}! I <i>demand</i> to know what is going on here! We are on a licensed expedition, and if you people think you can intimidate us into-"
// Answer Text :
"P4288174973" "Doctor, Arachnos is looking for you. I'm here to help."
// Answer Text :
"P2428825819" "Doctor, you need to come with me."
// Page Helpful Text :
"P2283448039" "<color orange>Harvan's look of indignation turns to momentary doubt.</color><br><br>Did you say... Arachnos? Oh, dear. I suppose I should have seen this coming.<br><br>If they're here for me, then they must be searching for Pandora's Box. You see, I happen to be the foremost researcher in the field of-"
// Answer Text :
"P2176912283" "I know, Doctor. I need to get you out of here."
// Page Helpful2 Text :
"P1822114511" "Oh, oh yes, of course. I'll follow you out.<br><br>Do be careful, young {Hero.gender=male man|lady}. I've heard Arachnos can be quite dangerous."
// Answer Text :
"P3641656989" "Yes, uh... thank you for the warning."
// Page Stern Text :
"P2597723311" "<color orange>Harvan puffs up with indignation.</color><br><br>Uncultured brute! I will not submit to your ham-handed attempts at intimidation! I demand to know the name of your employer!"
// Answer Text :
"P2915053603" "I'm a licensed Hero, and this is area is compromised. This isn't a request."
// Page Stern2 Text :
"P1172552546" "<color orange>Harvan stares at you for a moment, still defiant. A moment later, you see a flicker of doubt, then fear... and Harvan lets out a loud sigh.</color><br><br>Very well. Lead the way, I suppose."
// Answer Text :
"P4155899572" "Good. Follow me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PositronTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IsOwner Text :
"P906293467" "Hello again, {HeroName}. I hope you didn't mind the interruption. Mr. Nash let me know where you were headed, and we detected some heavy Arachnos activity shortly after you left.<br><br>It seems clear to me, given the resources they've devoted here, that Arachnos views Pandora's Box as a high value target. I'm mobilizing the Phalanx to react accordingly; any time Arachnos rears its head, I intend to be out in force to stop them.<br><br>For now, though, I'm simply glad that you managed to extract Dr. Harvan safely. I believe he is prepared to work with us towards a common goal of locating the Box. We've discussed the... ramifications of Recluse reaching the artifact first, and I believe we've come to an understanding."
// Answer Text :
"P528378691" "I'm glad to hear it."
// Page HarvanFriendly Text :
"P1356262359" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_James_Harvan width=128 height=128><color orange>Harvan beams at you.</color><br><br>I must say, I did not expect my savior to be so well-associated with the Freedom Phalanx.<br><br>I'll say to you what I said to Positron, {HeroName}. If you have the resources available to enable my research, and you can vouch for my safety, then you'll have my utmost cooperation.<br><br>This may be the best chance I have of completing my life's work. To see the legendary Pandora's Box with my own eyes... why, I can hardly wait to get started! Hah!"
// Answer Text :
"P118353243" "Glad to have you on board."
// Page HarvanHostile Text :
"P243469489" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_James_Harvan width=128 height=128><color orange>Harvan glares at you.</color><br><br>You know, you could learn a thing or two from your ally, young {Hero.gender=male man|lady}. What's the phrase again? 'You catch more flies with honey', or something to that effect.<br><br><i>Despite</i> how you have insisted on treating me, I've decided that I'll work with you. As far as I've seen, you're my best shot at seeing Pandora's Box in my lifetime... and I doubt Arachnos would have offered me such generous terms.<br><br><color orange>Dr. Harvan frowns, and his stance softens a bit.</color><br><br>However... I believe that I owe you my thanks. I've heard stories about Arachnos, and what they do to their captives. I'm glad I'm not in a position to tell one of those stories."
// Answer Text :
"P1307572280" "Just doing my job, Doctor. Let's go."
// Page FinalPage Text :
"P3362050004" "I'll make sure Dr. Harvan has the appropriate accomodations. Arachnos apparently has the same information on his career that we do, so it would be safest to keep him inside Fort Trident for now. I'll forward any pertinent information we obtain to Tony, for you to follow up on.<br><br>Good work out there, {HeroName}. To be brutally honest, I'm not sure the Phalanx is capable of handling this kind of crisis on its own. I'm glad we have you on the case."
// Answer Text :
"P1411570882" "All part of the job, right?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4109662167" "I contacted the Oxford administrative staff, and they told me that Dr. Harvan's working an expedition off the coast of Albania. I've set up transportation to get you there, but I'm afraid this might not be as simple as we'd hoped. We've got a problem."
// AcceptString :
"P2408206222" "And that is...?"
// SendOffString :
"P3848910654" "The lady I talked to at Oxford also mentioned that we weren't the only ones looking for info on Dr. Harvan. Others have been asking questions, and they discovered an intrusion into the administration's database sometime yesterday.<br><br>Suffice it to say, I don't think we're going to be the only ones looking for Dr. Harvan. I think you're going to need to hurry."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1972224801" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: High in Demand</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3414251895" "Track down James Harvan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3879179953" "{HeroName}, I'm not a Hero, so I'm not going to try to tell you how to do your job. I just want to impart the urgency of this situation: James Harvan may be the only person who can help us find Pandora's Box, and we're not the only ones looking for him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P394502593" "Here's hoping you were the first person to find this place."
