// Dialog :
"P2248153181" "You have defeated Lilitu, and retrieved the Antikythera."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1739284154" "Fantastic job, {HeroName}. Positron and Harvan are hard at work analyzing the Antikythera. So far, it sounds like this thing really could lead us to Pandora's Box.<br><br>I've gotta say, I didn't expect to get as much progress here as we did. You took a dead-end investigation and turned it into a real chance at finding this thing, and before someone like Recluse gets his mitts on it.<br><br>Me, on the other hand... I've been called in for reassignment. I think G.I.F.T. finally realized that Superadine wasn't the answer, here, so they're putting me on a different project. I'll admit, I'm a little relieved... it'll be good to work on something I'm familiar with, for a change.<br><br>See you around, {HeroName}. It's been a pleasure."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
